        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An open concept scheme for justification-based refinements of the effectual and ineffectual distinction. Concepts added to this scheme should be related to :Effectual or :Ineffectual with skos:broader. </rdfs:comment>
